# Google Map Tiles API key — powers the photorealistic Mumbai under the flight.
#
#  1. console.cloud.google.com  ->  create a project
#  2. APIs & Services -> Library -> search "Map Tiles API" -> Enable
#  3. APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key
#  4. Enable billing on the project (the free tier covers development use)
#  5. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste the key below, then restart
#     the dev server.
#
# Without a key the site works exactly as before, with a plain ground plane —
# nothing breaks, you just do not get the city.
#
# Note: `.env.local` is gitignored, so the key never reaches GitHub. Restrict
# the key to the Map Tiles API and to your site's domain in the Google console.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
